{"meta": {"notice": "No API key, so this request shares one free daily budget ($0.10) with everyone on your network's IP address. Get a free key with its own $1/day at https://openalex.org/settings/api and add api_key=YOUR_KEY to your requests. An AI agent can get one for its user in one call: POST https://api.openalex.org/api-keys with {\"email\": \"<your user's email>\"}; we email them a link, and the key works once they click it. Docs for agents: https://help.openalex.org/llms.txt", "count": 3483, "db_response_time_ms": 148, "page": 1, "per_page": 20, "groups_count": null, "x_query": {"oql": "get works with (公司 股利 分配 少数股东) in the full text", "x_new_oql": "get works with (公司 股利 分配 少数股东) in the full text", "oqo": {"get_rows": "works", "filter_rows": [{"column_id": "fulltext.search", "value": "公司 股利 分配 少数股东", "operator": "has"}]}, "url": "/works?filter=fulltext.search:%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8 %E8%82%A1%E5%88%A9 %E5%88%86%E9%85%8D %E5%B0%91%E6%95%B0%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C&per_page=20", "order": "best matches first", "order_default": true}, "cost_usd": 0.001}, "results": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/W2259199684", "doi": null, "title": "所有权和控制权的分离：治理效率、公司价值与股利分配", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5026264493", "display_name": "张天舒", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "张天舒", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"股东持股模式的不同造成公司股权结构的差异,其中的一个重要特征是,所有权与控制权的分离。利用2003-2010上市公司数据,本文从治理效率、市场价值和股利分配等角度对公司所有权和控制权的分离进行了系统考察。研究发现,当控股股东的所有权较低而控制权较高时,公司治理的效率下降,表现为公司业绩变差时不能及时更换不称职高管,并减弱了高管薪酬与公司业绩的敏感性。进一步的分析显示,由于与其他小股东的代理冲突严重,所有权与控制权相分离公司的市场价值较低。最后,鉴于控股股东在公司的剩余收益较小,所有权与控制权分离公司倾向于发放更少的股利。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2259199684", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/80048X/201503/663983713.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306545056", "display_name": "南京社会科学", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "南京社会科学", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2761936432", "doi": null, "title": "公司中小股东利润分配请求权的司法保护——基于《公司法解释四》（征求意见稿）第23、24条之规定", "publication_date": "2017-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5057274065", "display_name": "卢洋", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "卢洋", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"股东投资目的在于通过利润分配获得收益,因＂资本多数决＂和分配条件等因素,大股东操纵公司向中小股东不分或者少分利润。虽有异议回购请求权等救济方式,仍无法解决大股东侵害中小股东利润分配问题。《公司法解释四》（征求意见稿）规定中小股东可以提出强制利润分配请求权之诉来保护自己的利益,但仍略有不足,只有完善提起该诉条件,股份公司中小股东纳入权利主体,分配内容归入章程必要记载事项,才能实现投资目的,保障股东平等。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2761936432", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/83789X/201702/671819828.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764507749", "display_name": "Journal of Heilongjiang Administrative Cadre College of Politics and Law", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4366370254", "host_organization_name": "Heilongjiang Provicinal Political and Legal Administration", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4366370254"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Heilongjiang Provicinal Political and Legal Administration"], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "黑龙江省政法管理干部学院学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1151112142", "doi": null, "title": "中国股市“隧道行为”分析", "publication_date": "2004-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5067459601", "display_name": "李梅", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "李梅", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"隧道行为是指一个公司的资源被转移到其控股股东手中,这也是一种代理问题,是控股股东和分散的少数股东之间的利益冲突.发生在中国资本市场上的上市公司圈钱行为(钱从小股民手里流向上市公司,继而进一步流向大股东手里)便是这一类代理人问题的具体体现,中国特有的异股同权现象强化了大股东的这种剥夺小股东行为的动机,并且对上市公司的融资模式、经营运作以及利润分配等产生了一系列重大影响.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1151112142", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/97161X/200406/10864849.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306556910", "display_name": "经济学家", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "经济学家", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2254644420", "doi": null, "title": "股权分置改革、大股东支持的动机与后果———来自中国上市公司的经验证据", "publication_date": "2010-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5017872974", "display_name": "姚益龙", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "姚益龙", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "middle", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5006134468", "display_name": "Liang Wang", "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9023-0296", "observed_orcids": ["https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9023-0296"]}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "Liang Wang", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9023-0296", "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5003770244", "display_name": "罗党论", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "罗党论", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"大股东除了＂掏空＂上市公司外,是否还会存在利益支持行为,这种行为的真实性如何,股权分置改革又会怎样影响上述行为？本文以2002～2008年的上市公司关联交易数据为样本,研究发现,大股东对上市公司的利益支持行为并不具有持续性,支持更多地表现为＂制度性驱动＂,＂保壳＂和获得配股再融资资格是主要目的,大股东在支持后往往会伴随着明显的＂掏空＂行为。股权分置改革使大股东与中小股东的利益有趋同趋势,表现在,股权分置改革后,大股东增加了对上市公司的利益支持行为,并且大股东会显著减少因为支持而产生的＂掏空＂行为。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2254644420", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/96461A/201011/36048989.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764988258", "display_name": "Journal of Shanxi Finance and Economics University", "issn_l": "1007-9556", "issn": ["1007-9556"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4353108590", "host_organization_name": "Shanxi University of Finance and Economics", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4353108590"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Shanxi University of Finance and Economics"], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "山西财经大学学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2803090334", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.14071/j.1008-8105(2018)-1059", "title": "精英治理、股利政策与企业绩效—基于A股与“A+H”股的比较研究", "publication_date": "2019-10-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5000382319", "display_name": "陈颐", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "陈颐", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国上市公司的股利政策与其治理结构有无联系？公司高层愿为治理良好的公司付出多大的溢价？针对上市公司的分红问题，运用CSMAR经济金融研究数据库中2008～2015年间我国A股和“A+H”股的数据进行比较研究，考察公司运作过程中精英治理与股利政策之间的关系。研究发现，在A股样本中第一大股东的持股比例越高，公司越趋向于发放较多的现金股利，说明在中国内地，股权集中度有助于减少代理成本从而有利于现金股利的发放；中国股票市场的价格机制鼓励公司多发股利，这一点有助于解释第一大股东在股利发放中的积极性上，A股比“A+H”股公司相对较高的现象；上市公司董事长与总经理兼任对股利政策的影响不具显著性，这说明精英治理中的组织权力相较管理层的所有者权力对股利政策的影响更强；合理化的精英治理与股利政策对企业绩效具有正面积极的作用。因此，针对公司治理与股利分配问题的研究结论对完善治理结构与规范股利政策以及优化资本市场环境可以提供一定的意见参考。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2803090334", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.14071/j.1008-8105(2018)-1059", "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.social.uestc.edu.cn/article/id/0405b9b2-0888-421b-8aa8-e6fd7cc4d3f1", "pdf_url": null, "source": null, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": null, "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4414598040", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.63887/jfem.2025.1.4.20", "title": "控股股东股权质押行为对公司投资效率的影响及治理机制", "publication_date": "2025-09-12", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5119759553", "display_name": "梁亚玲", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/I4405278498", "display_name": "Henan University of Animal Husbandry and Economy", "ror": "https://ror.org/004pt8s39", "country_code": "CN", "type": "education", "lineage": ["https://openalex.org/I4405278498"]}], "countries": ["CN"], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "梁亚玲", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["河南牧业经济学院金融与会计学院"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "河南牧业经济学院金融与会计学院", "institution_ids": ["https://openalex.org/I4405278498"]}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本文探讨了控股股东股权质押对公司投资效率的影响。首先，分析了股权质押可能导致的“质押-融资-投资-再质押”恶性循环及投资不足问题，特别是在股权质押比例较高时，控股股东可能因短视化倾向而减少长期投资。然而，股权质押在某些情况下也可能通过倒逼机制提高投资效率，如加强控股股东对公司管理层的监督和支持主业投资。文章进一步探讨了股权质押影响投资效率的异质性特征，包括股权性质、市场化程度和质押比例的差异。国有企业因政府监管和社会责任，其股权质押对投资效率的负面影响相对较弱；而在市场化程度较低的地区，股权质押的负面效应更为显著。高质押比例可能引发非效率投资问题，而低质押比例则可能支持公司投资活动。为缓解股权质押的负面影响，文章提出了构建内部治理机制、外部治理机制和优化监管政策的建议，以实现企业价值与投资者利益的共赢。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.63887/jfem.2025.1.4.20", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.63887/jfem.2025.1.4.20", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.63887/jfem.2025.1.4.20", "pdf_url": "https://www.sci-open.net/index.php/JFM/article/download/2829/3742", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S5407047640", "display_name": "财经管理", "issn_l": "3058-8243", "issn": ["3058-8243", "3059-0000"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "财经管理", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4210776326", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.26549/cjygl.v4i6.4375", "title": "海底捞股份有限公司财务报表分析", "publication_date": "2020-07-03", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5008497016", "display_name": "莉 杨", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/I4405278815", "display_name": "Guangzhou Huali Science and Technology Vocational College", "ror": "https://ror.org/00kf6nm40", "country_code": "CN", "type": "education", "lineage": ["https://openalex.org/I4405278815"]}], "countries": ["CN"], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "莉 杨", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["广州华立科技职业学院，中国"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "广州华立科技职业学院，中国", "institution_ids": ["https://openalex.org/I4405278815"]}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"企业财务报表分析是指以财务报表和其他资料为依据和起点，采用专门的方法，系统分析和评价企业过去及现在的经营成果、财务状况及其变动，以了解企业过去的经营业绩，衡量企业目前财务状况并且预测企业未来的发展趋势，帮助企业利益集团改善决策。论文以海底捞": [0], "2015": [1], "年至": [2], "2019": [3], "年的的财务报表等相关数据为基础，从偿债能力、盈利能力、营运能力及发展能力对其进行全面的分析，针对其存在的问题提出建议。": [4]}, "cited_by_count": 8, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.26549/cjygl.v4i6.4375", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.26549/cjygl.v4i6.4375", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.26549/cjygl.v4i6.4375", "pdf_url": "https://ojs.s-p.sg/index.php/cjygl/article/download/4375/pdf", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4210171802", "display_name": "财经与管理", "issn_l": "2529-783X", "issn": ["2529-783X", "2529-7848"], "is_oa": true, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4324004150", "host_organization_name": "Synergy Publishing Pte. Ltd.", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4324004150"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Synergy Publishing Pte. Ltd."], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "财经与管理", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W595704697", "doi": null, "title": "家族企业集团：金字塔结构、多元化经营、企业绩效——来自中国家族上市公司的经验证据", "publication_date": "2012-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5046165133", "display_name": "苏勇", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "苏勇", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5022437227", "display_name": "Jun Zhang", "orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5168-9942", "observed_orcids": ["https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5168-9942", "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7305-1832"]}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "Jun Zhang", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5168-9942", "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"文章利用中国A股市场家族上市公司的数据，从企业集团多元化经营行为的视角，研究了家族控制股东侵占与公司治理问题。研究发现，在投资者保护水平低的现阶段，家族大股东通过金字塔持股等方式实现了对上市公司的现金流权和控制权分离，使其有动机也有机会通过多元化经营侵占少数股东的利益；在要素市场尚未完全发育的条件下，虽然多元化经营对建立内部资本市场从而提高企业价值具有积极的意义，但总体看家族大股东侵占产生的代理成本大于资源配置效率提高带来的收益，企业集团成员公司的绩效与多元化经营负相关。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:595704697", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/91326X/201205/41900962.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306543902", "display_name": "兰州学刊", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "兰州学刊", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4416839114", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.63887/ssrp.2025.1.8.62", "title": "新《公司法》修订后中小股东权利保护机制研究", "publication_date": "2025-11-22", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5120622024", "display_name": "高传国", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "高传国", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["北京市致宏律师事务所"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "北京市致宏律师事务所", "institution_ids": []}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"为探索更行之有效的中小股东权利保护路径，本文以新修订的《中华人民共和国公司法》为对象，探讨中小股东权利保护机制。首先介绍该法律法规对中小股东权利的保护作用，有利于创建更公平公正的营商环境、提高公司治理能力。其次介绍中小股东权利保护的根本原则，提出进一步加强中小股东的股东知情权、保障股东表决权、探索更多元化的法律救济形式三点建议，在保证公司股东合法权益的同时，以期能为相关研究提供参考。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.63887/ssrp.2025.1.8.62", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.63887/ssrp.2025.1.8.62", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.63887/ssrp.2025.1.8.62", "pdf_url": "https://www.sci-open.net/index.php/SSRP/article/download/5494/7042", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S5407047643", "display_name": "社会科学研究与实践", "issn_l": "3058-8936", "issn": ["3058-8936", "3059-0272"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc-nd", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc-nd", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "社会科学研究与实践", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W7170351759", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.64649/yh.shfzykjcx.2025090005", "title": "股东失权制度下的债权人利益保护研究", "publication_date": "2025-12-18", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5143597915", "display_name": "雪 苗", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "雪 苗", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"新《中华人民共和国公司法》第52条确立了股东失权制度，剥夺到期不履行出资义务股东的相应股权，对于保护公司资本信用、规范股东出资义务具有重要制度价值。但现有的制度规则存在多方面漏洞，债权人也面临各种风险和挑战：欠资股权无人受让、公司债务清偿能力下降、其他股东资本补足困难，以及监督程序缺位、归责标准模糊等。为完善股东失权下债权人利益保护，需从责任划分和程序监督进行双向细化：厘清失权股东与股权受让人的连带出资责任、细化减资程序下股东补充赔偿责任、畅通债权人参与失权程序的通道、合理设定股权转让、减资注销、其他股东补缴的先后顺位，平衡公司、股东与债权人的利益。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.64649/yh.shfzykjcx.2025090005", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.64649/yh.shfzykjcx.2025090005", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.64649/yh.shfzykjcx.2025090005", "pdf_url": "https://www.sjzyhwh.cn/journal/shfzykjcx/2025/9/5.pdf", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S5407051074", "display_name": "社会发展与科技创新", "issn_l": "3078-8994", "issn": ["3078-8994", "3104-4492"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "社会发展与科技创新", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W821844658", "doi": null, "title": "跻身世界食品之林──记上海梅林食品(集团)公司", "publication_date": "1996-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5022044625", "display_name": "冯定云", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "冯定云", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5051457555", "display_name": "钟琳虹", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "钟琳虹", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"近年来，国内食品行业竞争日趋激烈，尤其是广东一些内外资企业生产的饼干、饮料和巧克力等食品，给上海食品业带来了一股又一股强大的冲击波，不少企业连续数年效益滑坡，处境很是艰难。以生产梅林罐头而闻名的上海梅林食品（集团）公司，在逆境中以深化改革为强大推动力，加快企业发展。他们优化资源配置，拓展合资、合作，实施名牌战略，开发新一代食品，使企业的资产规模不断扩大，经济效益大幅度增长。1993年以来，公司的销售收入、利税分别以每年50％和30％的速度递增。1995年销售收入达31．3亿元，实现利润3．5亿元，出口创汇200万美元，分别比上年增长54．2％、40％和2．1倍，公司已成为国内食品行业的支柱企业": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:821844658", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81046X/199604/683726783199604015.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306540874", "display_name": "上海财税", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "上海财税", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4246674543", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.37155/2717-5642-0102-2", "title": "股权收购对公司治理结构和治理效率的影响", "publication_date": "2020-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5058449073", "display_name": "孙平军", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "孙平军", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["北京中科云投科技股份有限公司"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "北京中科云投科技股份有限公司", "institution_ids": []}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"随着全球化的到来，越来越多的企业为了获得更加宽广的市场，并且实现自身内部治理结构体系的全面优化，开始着手于并购活动。在现行的企业制度之下，因为企业信息和利益之间存有明显的矛盾，导致企业的控制权以及所有权相分离，造成管理者和股东之间出现了委托代理方面的问题。基于此，本文以A公司为例就股权收购对公司治理结构和治理效率的影响展开了深入以及全面的探究分析，期望经过该研究可以为将来的有关研究提供科学合理的参考。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 1, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.37155/2717-5642-0102-2", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.37155/2717-5642-0102-2", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.37155/2717-5642-0102-2", "pdf_url": "http://ojs.omniscient.sg/index.php/iem/article/download/773/730", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4210195728", "display_name": "国际经济与管理", "issn_l": "2717-5642", "issn": ["2717-5642"], "is_oa": true, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "国际经济与管理", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4401636950", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.33142/mem.v5i1.11155", "title": "我国上市公司关联交易问题研究——江苏徐矿能源股份有限公司为例", "publication_date": "2024-02-28", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5106562391", "display_name": "冬冬 窦", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "冬冬 窦", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["Jiangsu Xukuang Energy Co., Ltd. , Xuzhou , Jiangsu , 221000 , China"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "Jiangsu Xukuang Energy Co., Ltd. , Xuzhou , Jiangsu , 221000 , China", "institution_ids": []}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本研究聚焦于中国上市公司的关联交易问题，以江苏徐矿能源股份有限公司为案例，深入探讨了关联交易的作用机理和主要驱动因素。研究指出，关联交易在资本运作、资源配置和内部控制中扮演了重要角色，但同时也带来潜在的利益冲突和管理挑战。研究分析了体制转轨因素和证券制度因素对关联交易的影响，并分析了江苏徐矿能源股份有限公司的具体做法，提出了有效管理关联交易的策略。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.33142/mem.v5i1.11155", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.33142/mem.v5i1.11155", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "http://dx.doi.org/10.33142/mem.v5i1.11155", "pdf_url": "https://journals.viserdata.com/index.php/mem/article/download/11155/11067", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4210238722", "display_name": "现代经济管理", "issn_l": "2717-5502", "issn": ["2717-5502", "2717-5510"], "is_oa": true, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4404660689", "host_organization_name": "Viser Technology Pte. Ltd.", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4404660689"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Viser Technology Pte. Ltd."], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "现代经济管理", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4232305833", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.33142/mfm.v1i3.2560", "title": "价值链管理在某市Y投资控股集团有限公司的应用", "publication_date": "2020-10-22", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5087675093", "display_name": "珊 王", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "珊 王", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"某市Y投资控股集团有限公司为江西地区的本地城建开发商，主要从事政府投资项目代建、公用基础设施项目投资建设、房地产开发及投资建设、城乡道路投资建设、新农村投资建设等工作，注册资金为11亿元，是一家名副其实的大型国有企业。文章以某市Y投资控股集团有限公司为例，分析其财务管理现状及管理会计工具方法的使用现状，从设计目标、思路、内容和创新四个方面总结该公司管理会计工具方法如何应用到财务管理中，同时通过实际财务数据分析其管理会计取得的成效并进行评价，最后根据某市Y投资控股集团有限公司财务管理对管理会计的应用和成效进行经验总结，提出管理会计工具方法应用成功的条件、因素、优化方式、优缺点和建议，希望为其他企业财务管理中管理会计工具方法的应用提供参考。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 5, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.33142/mfm.v1i3.2560", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.33142/mfm.v1i3.2560", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.33142/mfm.v1i3.2560", "pdf_url": "https://journals.viserdata.com/index.php/mem/article/download/2560/2493", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4210238722", "display_name": "现代经济管理", "issn_l": "2717-5502", "issn": ["2717-5502", "2717-5510"], "is_oa": true, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4404660689", "host_organization_name": "Viser Technology Pte. Ltd.", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4404660689"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Viser Technology Pte. Ltd."], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "现代经济管理", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4386292032", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.55375/jls.2023.2.10", "title": "论我国上市公司强制要约收购与豁免要约", "publication_date": "2023-08-30", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5092718538", "display_name": "莉丽 赵", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "莉丽 赵", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本文对我国上市公司的强制要约收购必要性进行了分析。同时，本文梳理了豁免要约相关制度的变化以及相关豁免情形的适用。最后，本文分析了强制要约收购制度对大股东及中小股东权益保护的平衡并提出如下建议：对于不会导致控制权变更的股东增持可以扩大豁免要约的适用情形。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 9, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.55375/jls.2023.2.10", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.55375/jls.2023.2.10", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.55375/jls.2023.2.10", "pdf_url": "https://qingpress.com/fs/Upload/Enclosures/3db04248-73f9-4e4a-a509-3798e2449c6d.pdf", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4387279007", "display_name": "现代法学研究", "issn_l": "2790-3796", "issn": ["2790-3796"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "现代法学研究", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W7214430401", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.70693/202608028613", "title": "新《公司法》适用下破产股东出资追缴的困境与纾解 ——基于责任识别至权利救济的全流程规范展开", "publication_date": "2026-09-08", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5084577143", "display_name": "Yuhuan Pu", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "蒲余欢", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["嘉兴大学文法学院"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "嘉兴大学文法学院", "institution_ids": []}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"新《公司法》实施后，与《企业破产法》在股东出资追缴方面存在适用冲突，司法实践裁判尺度不一、个别债权人借助加速到期规则规避破产集体清偿。结合裁判数据与管理人实务调研，通过规范解释搭建出资追缴全流程分析框架，区分各类出资瑕疵认定标准，划定追缴路径适用顺序，建立分层追缴机制；确立破产程序优先规则，明晰股权转让责任新旧法适用界限，追缴费用按破产费用优先清偿，区分清算、重整、和解设置差异化财产处置规则，配套股东追偿、债权人追加分配、管理人追责救济渠道，打通两法衔接路径，平衡债权人受偿权益与股东责任边界，形成适配破产实务的一体化处置方案，统一类案裁判标准、规范管理人履职。": [0]